# Photography.
#
# The 177 source photographs in `images/` show identifiable participants,
# including minors. Consent was given for publication on the website, not for
# publication in a public repository — and this repository is public. Keeping
# them out of git is the difference between "published on imarishadada.org"
# and "published on github.com/mwasobaddy/imarishadada", permanently and
# outside the site's consent gating.
#
# The images the site actually serves live in `public/images/`. The ones under
# a consent tier live in `private-assets/`.
/images/

# Consent-gated participant photographs, staged for Supabase Storage.
/private-assets/
